{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WeatherBlend 是一款專為追求精準天氣資訊的用戶設計的應用，它能結合超過 50 個可信賴的氣象模型與開放天氣服務，生成單一智能預報。不同於依賴單一來源，該 App 通過比較多個預測結果並計算混合數據，同時顯示基於模型一致性程度的預測信心指數。目前正值限時免費優惠期間，原本售價為 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>多模型融合與信心指標</h2>\n<p>此應用核心在於將分散的天氣數據轉化為直觀決策依據。除了提供即時天氣、每小時及未來 10 天詳細預報外，更涵蓋空氣質素指數、紫外線強度、花粉預測及健康風險提示。針對戶外愛好者，它提供跑步、遠足、帆船等多種活動的環境評分，讓你在出發前就能掌握最全面的大氣狀況與個人化建議。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-207-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-208-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-210-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-211-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-212-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WeatherBlend</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T10:20:40.719155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}